      explanation: "Present Perfect'da 'have/has' + fe'lning 3-chi shakli (V3) ishlatiladi. I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has. V3 ni yod olish kerak: go→gone, eat→eaten, see→seen.",
