  rules: [
    "1️⃣ QACHON ISHLATILADI?\n\nFuture Continuous kelajakda bir vaqtda davom etayotgan harakatlar uchun ishlatiladi. 4 ta asosiy holat:\n\n📌 ANIQ VAQTDA DAVOM ETADIGAN HARAKAT: Kelajakdagi biror vaqtda nima qilib turgan bo'lamiz?\n  → I will be sleeping at 10 PM tonight. (Bugun kechki 10 da uxlab yotgan bo'laman)\n  → At 3 PM tomorrow, we will be flying to London. (Ertaga soat 3 da Londonga uchayotgan bo'lamiz)\n\n📌 IKKI HARAKAT BIR VAQTDA: Bir vaqtda ikkita harakat sodir bo'lganda.\n  → While you are shopping, I will be cooking dinner. (Sen xarid qilayotganingda, men ovqat pishirayotgan bo'laman)\n  → I'll be studying while she watches TV. (U TV ko'rayotganda men o'qiyotgan bo'laman)\n\n📌 KELAJAKDAGI REJALAR (ongoing): Kelajakda ma'lum muddat davom etadigan harakatlar.\n  → This time next week, we will be relaxing on the beach. (Kelasi hafta shu vaqtda plyajda dam olayotgan bo'lamiz)\n  → I will be working on the project all day tomorrow. (Ertaga kun bo'yi loyiha ustida ishlayotgan bo'laman)\n\n📌 XUSHXUROMLIK BILAN SO'ROQ (Polite questions): Kimningdir rejalari haqida so'rash.\n  → Will you be using the car tonight? (Bugun kechqurun mashinani ishlatasizmi?)\n  → Will you be going to the supermarket later? (Keyinroq supermarketga borasizmi?)",
    "2️⃣ QANDAY YASALADI?\n\nIjobiy shakl (Affirmative):\n  Subject + will be + verb + ing\n\n  I will be sleeping at 10 PM. (Soat 10 da uxlab yotgan bo'laman)\n  She will be working on the report. (U hisobot ustida ishlayotgan bo'ladi)\n  They will be traveling to Paris. (Ular Parijga sayohat qilayotgan bo'lishadi)\n\n  📌 Qisqa shakl:\n    I will be → I'll be\n    She will be → She'll be\n    I'll be working. (Men ishlayotgan bo'laman)\n    We'll be waiting for you. (Biz sizni kutayotgan bo'lamiz)\n\n  📌 -ing qo'shimchasi qoidalari:\n    • Aksariyat fe'llar: work → working, play → playing, sleep → sleeping\n    • -e bilan tugagan fe'llar: make → making, write → writing, take → taking\n    • CVC (undosh+unli+undosh): sit → sitting, run → running, swim → swimming\n    • -ie bilan tugagan fe'llar: lie → lying, die → dying",
    "3️⃣ INKOR SHAKLI (Negative)\n\n  Subject + won't be + verb-ing\n\n  I won't be sleeping at midnight. (Men yarim tunda uxlab yotgan bo'lmayman)\n  She won't be working tomorrow. (U ertaga ishlayotgan bo'lmaydi)\n  They won't be attending the meeting. (Ular yig'ilishda qatnashayotgan bo'lmaydi)\n\n  🔴 MUHIM: 'Will not be' (to'liq shakl) rasmiy usul:\n    I will not be working tomorrow. (Men ertaga ishlayotgan bo'lmayman)\n\n  ❌ He won't be working at 5. (to'g'ri)\n  ❌ He won't working ❌ (be tushib qolgan)\n  ✅ He won't be working ✓ (to'g'ri)\n\n  📌 Eslatma: 'won't be' dan keyin doim V-ing keladi!\n    won't be + sleeping, won't be + going, won't be + doing",
    "4️⃣ SAVOL SHAKLI (Questions)\n\n  Will + subject + be + verb-ing?\n\n  Will you be working at 6 PM? (Soat 6 da ishlayotgan bo'lasizmi?)\n  Will she be coming to the party? (U ziyofatga kelayotgan bo'ladimi?)\n  Will they be staying at a hotel? (Ular mehmonxonada qolayotgan bo'lishadimi?)\n\n  Qisqa javoblar:\n    Will you be using the car? → Yes, I will. / No, I won't.\n    Will she be joining us? → Yes, she will. / No, she won't.\n\n  WH-savollar:\n    What will you be doing at 8 PM? (Soat 8 da nima qilib turgan bo'lasiz?)\n    Where will you be staying? (Qayerda qolayotgan bo'lasiz?)\n    How long will you be working? (Qancha vaqt ishlayotgan bo'lasiz?)",
    "5️⃣ VAQT BELGILARI (Time Expressions)\n\nFuture Continuous bilan tez-tez ishlatiladigan vaqt belgilari:\n\n  at + vaqt → ... da\n    I will be sleeping at midnight. (Yarim tunda uxlab yotgan bo'laman)\n    At 5 PM tomorrow, I'll be flying. (Ertaga soat 5 da uchayotgan bo'laman)\n\n  this time next... → kelasi... shu vaqtda\n    This time next week, we'll be sunbathing. (Kelasi hafta shu vaqtda quyoshlanayotgan bo'lamiz)\n    This time next year, I'll be living in London. (Kelasi yil shu vaqtda Londonda yashayotgan bo'laman)\n\n  all day/night/week → kun bo'yi/tun bo'yi/hafta bo'yi\n    I will be studying all night. (Tun bo'yi o'qiyotgan bo'laman)\n    She'll be working all day. (U kun bo'yi ishlayotgan bo'ladi)\n\n  while + present → ... paytida\n    While you sleep, I'll be working. (Sen uxlayotganingda men ishlayotgan bo'laman)\n\n  between...and... → ...dan ...gacha\n    Between 2 and 4, we'll be having a meeting. (Soat 2 dan 4 gacha yig'ilish o'tkazyatgan bo'lamiz)",
    "6️⃣ O'ZBEKCHA FARQLAR (Uzbek vs English)\n\nO'zbek tilida Future Continuous ga o'xshash aniq zamon shakli yo'q. O'zbeklar '-ayotgan bo'laman', '-yapman bo'laman' deb tarjima qilishadi.\n\n  'Men soat 10 da uxlab yotgan bo'laman' → I will be sleeping at 10.\n  'U ertaga ishlayotgan bo'ladi' → She will be working tomorrow.\n\nO'zbeklarning eng keng tarqalgan xatolari:\n  • I will working ❌ → I will be working ✓ ('be' tushib qoladi)\n  • She will be works ❌ → She will be working ✓ (fe'l -ing da, -s emas)\n  • I won't working ❌ → I won't be working ✓ (be + V-ing)\n  • Will you working? ❌ → Will you be working? ✓ (be qo'shilishi kerak)\n  • He will be sleep ❌ → He will be sleeping ✓ (-ing qo'shimchasi kerak)\n  • While I will cook, she will be watching ❌ → While I cook, she will be watching ✓ (while dan keyin Simple Present)\n\n  🔥 ESLATMA: Future Continuous Future Simple dan farqli: bir vaqtda davom etayotgan harakatni ta'kidlaydi.",
    "7️⃣ FUTURE SIMPLE vs FUTURE CONTINUOUS — farqlar\n\nIkkalasi kelajak zamoni, ammo asosiy farqi: FS → to'liq harakat, FC → davom etayotgan harakat\n\nFUTURE SIMPLE (will + verb):\n  ✅ Harakatning to'liq bajarilishiga e'tibor:\n    'I will call you tomorrow.' (Ertaga qo'ng'iroq qilaman — tugallangan harakat)\n    'She will finish the project.' (U loyihani tugatadi — natija)\n\nFUTURE CONTINUOUS (will be + V-ing):\n  ✅ Bir vaqtda davom etayotgan harakatga e'tibor:\n    'I will be calling you at 8 PM.' (Soat 8 da qo'ng'iroq qilayotgan bo'laman — jarayon)\n    'She will be working on the project all day.' (U kun bo'yi loyiha ustida ishlayotgan bo'ladi)\n\n🔥 QIYOSLASH:\n  'I will study tonight.' → o'qishni boshlayman va tugataman (FS)\n  'I will be studying tonight.' → o'qish jarayonida bo'laman, qachon boshlangan/qachon tugagan muhim emas (FC)\n\n  'I will write the report.' → hisobotni yozib tugataman\n  'I will be writing the report.' → hisobot yozish jarayonida bo'laman\n\n  'She will arrive at 6.' → u soat 6 da yetib keladi (aniq nuqta)\n  'She will be arriving at 6.' → u soat 6 da yetib kelayotgan bo'ladi (jarayon)\n\n🎯 QISQA QOIDA:\n  FS = natija / tugallangan harakat (I will do it)\n  FC = jarayon / vaqt oralig'i (I will be doing it at that time)",
  ],
